    389  f1db							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    390  f1db							; TitleIntro — intro-screen ($FD) edge check. Entered by JMP from DropStep
    391  f1db							; (no pending return; tail-jumps out — never rts, or it would pop a stale
    392  f1db							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    393  f1db							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    394  f1db							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    395  f1db							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
    396  f1db							; Always re-samples StepsLeft (title-owned on intro/title frames;
    397  f1db							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    398  f1db							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    399  f1db							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
    400  f1db							; Clobbers A/X/Temp. Ends at TitleTailAudio (silence + overscan wait).
    401  f1db							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
